Patrick wants to know if I have any
tricks for conquering insomnia.

00:01:25.430 --> 00:01:27.500
I react to stress with sleep

00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:31.490
I'm like a, like one of those sheep that
gets scared and falls over. Or are those

00:01:31.490 --> 00:01:34.880
